## 16. Disclaimer

This project is an independent learning and portfolio exercise based on a fictional financial services organisation.

All business rules, assumptions, datasets, calculations and results are illustrative.

The project does not represent an actual company incentive policy, Varicent implementation, enterprise deployment or production payout process.

The purpose is to demonstrate an understanding of incentive compensation management, business analysis, product requirement documentation, data handling, calculation logic, testing and validation.
